+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+Our services need a standard way to refer to a value inside a JSON document. RFC 6901 (JSON Pointer) is the published standard for this, and later features of the toolkit will build on it.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `resolvePointer(document, pointer)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, that returns the value a JSON Pointer refers to.
+- It throws when the pointer is not a valid RFC 6901 pointer, or when it does not resolve to a value of the document.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-pointer`: parsing and resolving RFC 6901 JSON Pointers against a JSON document.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- New `src/` code and tests; first source file of the library. No dependencies added.
+- Public API of the library gains `resolvePointer`.
